<title>NETHERLANDS: KEMPEN 1996 NET ALMOST DOUBLED.</title>
<headline>KEMPEN 1996 NET ALMOST DOUBLED.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.17 vs   1.65</p>
<p>    Net profit			    30.2  vs  15.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.50 vs   0.80</p>
<p>    Total income			  87.7  vs  52.3</p>
<p>    Total costs			   45.0  vs  31.2</p>
<p>    Tax				     12.5  vs   5.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Merchant bank Kempen &amp; Co NV previously said it</p>
<p>expected profits to rise in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
